window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Blueprints, blood, and bridging two worlds.</b></p> <p>Elana Bishop always knew she was different. She never imagined how much. Thrust into a world of ancient vampire conspiracies, Elana discovers she's not just a newly-awakened vampire—she's royalty.</p> <p>Determined to use her privileged position for good, Elana hatches an ambitious plan to revolutionize construction using vampire technology. She envisions a future where humans and vampires live side-by-side, learning from each other.</p> <p><i>Not everyone wants to see those walls come down.</i></p> <p>With assassins lurking in the shadows and a mysterious serial killer targeting vampires, Elana must master her newfound powers quickly. Her ability gives her an edge, but will it be enough to unravel the web of secrets left behind by her murdered mother?</p> <p>As Elana fights to build a better future, she finds herself caught between two worlds—and hunted by both. She'll need every ounce of her determination, wit, and newfound vampire strength to survive.</p> <p>Can Elana bridge the divide between humans and vampires? Or will centuries of mistrust and fear prove too much for even the most insightful of mediators?</p>"; 
